x (CWC)? Whether you\'re chasing adrenaline on the water or looking for a relaxing getaway, this guide covers everything you need to know before you go. From travel tips to must-try activities, get ready for a smooth and unforgettable experience.</p>\n<h2>Getting There</h2>\n<p>CWC is located in Camarines Sur and is accessible by land or air. If you\'re coming from Manila, you can take a short flight to Naga City or enjoy a scenic road trip. From there, it\'s just a quick ride to the park.</p>\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/landing-activities.webp\" alt=\"getting there\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<h2>Best Time to Visit</h2>\n<p>CWC is located in Camarines Sur and is accessible by land or air. If you\'re coming from Manila, you can take a short flight to Naga City or enjoy a scenic road trip. From there, it\'s just a quick ride to the park.</p>\n<h3>Weekday vs Weekend</h3>\n<p>Weekdays are ideal if you want to avoid crowds, while weekends offer a more lively atmosphere with more activities and events.</p>\n<h2>What to Bring</h2>\n<p>CWC is located in Camarines Sur and is accessible by land or air. If you\'re coming from Manila, you can take a short flight to Naga City or enjoy a scenic road trip. From there, it\'s just a quick ride to the park.</p>\n<h3>Essentials</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Swimwear and extra clothes</li>\n<li>Sunscreen and sunglasses</li>\n<li>Waterproof bag for valuables</li>\n<li>Slippers or comfortable footwear</li>\n</ul>\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"720px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/cabana-rentals.webp\" alt=\"what to bring\" style=\"width:720px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<h2>Accommodation Options</h2>\n<p>Stay close to the action with cozy, air-conditioned rooms within the complex. Booking in advance is highly recommended, especially during peak seasons and holidays.</p>\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p>A trip to CWC is all about balance—thrill and relaxation, activity and downtime. With the right planning, you can make the most out of your visit and create an unforgettable experience.</p>','Plan Your Trip: What to Know Before Visiting CWC','From travel essentials to insider tips and everything you need to plan a smooth and stress-free visit to CWC.','inherit','closed','closed','','330-revision-v1','','','2026-04-24 03:13:29','2026-04-24 03:13:29','',330,'http://project-cwc.local/?p=387',0,'revision','',0),(388,1,'2026-04-24 03:14:40','2026-04-24 03:14:40','','getting-there','','inherit','open','closed','','getting-there','','','2026-04-24 03:14:40','2026-04-24 03:14:40','',330,'http://project-cwc.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/getting-there.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(389,1,'2026-04-24 03:14:46','2026-04-24 03:14:46','<h2>Introduction</h2>\n<p>Planning a trip to CamSur Watersports Complex (CWC)? Whether you\'re chasing adrenaline on the water or looking for a relaxing getaway, this guide covers everything you need to know before you go. From travel tips to must-try activities, get ready for a smooth and unforgettable experience.</p>\n<h2>Getting There</h2>\n<p>CWC is located in Camarines Sur and is accessible by land or air. If you\'re coming from Manila, you can take a short flight to Naga City or enjoy a scenic road trip. From there, it\'s just a quick ride to the park.</p>\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":388,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://project-cwc.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/getting-there.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-388\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<h2>Best Time to Visit</h2>\n<p>CWC is located in Camarines Sur and is accessible by land or air. If you\'re coming from Manila, you can take a short flight to Naga 