bles</li>\n<li>Slippers or comfortable footwear</li>\n</ul>\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":391,\"width\":\"720px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"http://project-cwc.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/blog-image-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-391\" style=\"width:720px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<h2>Accommodation Options</h2>\n<p>Stay close to the action with cozy, air-conditioned rooms within the complex. Booking in advance is highly recommended, especially during peak seasons and holidays.</p>\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p>A trip to CWC is all about balance—thrill and relaxation, activity and downtime. With the right planning, you can make the most out of your visit and create an unforgettable experience.</p>','Plan Your Trip: What to Know Before Visiting CWC','From travel essentials to insider tips and everything you need to plan a smooth and stress-free visit to CWC.','inherit','closed','closed','','330-revision-v1','','','2026-04-24 03:23:39','2026-04-24 03:23:39','',330,'http://project-cwc.local/?p=392',0,'revision','',0),(393,1,'2026-04-24 05:20:05','2026-04-24 05:20:05','','conquer-the-land','','inherit','open','closed','','conquer-the-land','','','2026-04-24 05:20:05','2026-04-24 05:20:05','',0,'http://project-cwc.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/conquer-the-land.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(394,1,'2026-04-24 08:46:15','2026-04-24 08:46:15','','pickleball-1','','inherit','open','closed','','pickleball-1','','','2026-04-24 08:46:15','2026-04-24 08:46:15','',0,'http://project-cwc.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/pickleball-1.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(395,1,'2026-04-24 08:46:16','2026-04-24 08:46:16','','pickleball-2','','inherit','open','closed','','pickleball-2','','','2026-04-24 08:46:16','2026-04-24 08:46:16','',0,'http://project-cwc.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/pickleball-2.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',